  "comments": [
    {
      "author": "Grigfall",
      "created_at": "2025-07-18",
      "text": "The new government will stick to the 2038-at-the-latest target.\\[[1](https://www.cleanenergywire.org/news/prospective-new-german-government-shows-no-ambition-speed-coal-exit)]\n\nLast year, voluntary coal closures were substantial enough that no mandatory coal closures were required.\\[[2](https://www.cleanenergywire.org/news/germanys-coal-exit-on-track-no-forced-closures-needed)]",
      "prediction": null
    },
    {
      "author": "exmateriae",
      "created_at": "2023-03-13",
      "text": "Germany also said they would forbid gas car before 2035 and have now retracted it. I really don't think they will be able to go out of coal in 7 years.",
      "prediction": null
    },
    {
      "author": "Grigfall",
      "created_at": "2022-10-05",
      "text": "While mothballed and reserved coal plants have been brought online in the short term, German utility RWE has brought forward its coal closures from 2038 to 2030, as promised by the Govt. [1](https://www.lemonde.fr/en/energies/article/2022/10/04/german-firm-rwe-to-ditch-coal-power-by-2030-says-ceo_5999067_98.html)",
      "prediction": null
    },
    {
      "author": "Grigfall",
      "created_at": "2022-03-03",
      "text": "Germany's Economy Minister says the country has been too reliant on imports of Russian fossil fuels, and announces plans to accelerate Germany's renewable transition while rejecting calls to delay announced nuclear and coal exits.\n\nOne third of German gas and one half of German coal are Russian imports ([Reuters](https://www.reuters.com/business/energy/germany-hike-onshore-wind-solar-tender-volumes-document-2022-02-28/))",
      "prediction": null
    },
    {
      "author": "Grigfall",
      "created_at": "2021-11-25",
      "text": "The new SDP-Green-FDP coalition will [\"ideally\" move the phase out of coal earlier, to 2030](https://www.reuters.com/markets/commodities/german-coalition-commits-faster-decarbonisation-2021-11-24/).",
      "prediction": null
    },
    {
      "author": "casens",
      "created_at": "2021-09-01",
      "text": "@(casens) @TheBillby added a clause for retroactive closure",
      "prediction": null
    },
